PN,33101
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785514721
OL,3,CBlind man who drink-drove 150 miles
OL,4,C'followed HGV lights'
OL,6,FA blind motorist who drink-drove his
OL,7,Fpartner's car for 150 miles at night
OL,8,Fand without permission has admitted
OL,9,Fdangerous driving.
OL,11,FAnthony Hall, aged 49, was spotted at
OL,12,F1.45am behind the wheel of a Vauxhall
OL,13,FMeriva on the M6 northbound, north of
OL,14,FCarlisle, on 29 June.
OL,16,FCumbria Magistrates Court heard that
OL,17,FHall is registered blind, does not
OL,18,Fhave a driving licence, is not allowed
OL,19,Fto drive and took the car from a
OL,20,Fpartner without permission.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
