OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785514721
OL,3,CBlind man who drink-drove 150 miles
OL,4,C'followed HGV lights'
OL,6,FHe had driven some 150 miles from
OL,7,FHuddersfield when he was spotted by a
OL,8,Fpolice officer drifting on to the hard
OL,9,Fshoulder and from lane one to two.
OL,11,FProsector Suresh Basra told court:
OL,12,F"(The officer) has stopped the
OL,13,Fvehicle, spoken to Mr Hall and asked
OL,14,Fwhether he had consumed alcohol. He
OL,15,Fsaid 'yes'. He said he went blind
OL,16,Fabout two years ago."
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@BpmtD@Npn
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785514721
OL,3,CBlind man who drink-drove 150 miles
OL,4,C'followed HGV lights'
OL,6,FHall, of Lees Close, Huddersfield,
OL,7,Fprovided a positive roadside breath
OL,8,Ftest. An evidential police station
OL,9,Fsample showed 46micrograms of alcohol
OL,10,Fin 100 millilitres of breath. The
OL,11,Flegal driving limit is 35mcg.
OL,13,F"He was asked how he managed to drive.
OL,14,FHe said he was just following HGV
OL,15,Flights," the prosecutor said.
OL,17,FThe prosecutor added: "It is a
OL,18,Fprolonged and persistent course of
OL,19,Fdangerous driving ` a deliberate
OL,20,Fdecision to ignore the rules of the
OL,21,Froad."
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@HO]yD@WOU}D@FO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785514721
OL,3,CBlind man who drink-drove 150 miles
OL,4,C'followed HGV lights'
OL,6,FThere were no injuries or damage
OL,7,Fcaused during the offence.
OL,9,FIn court Hall, who entered court
OL,10,Fwearing dark glasses and using a while
OL,11,Fstick, pleaded guilty to dangerous
OL,12,Fdriving, taking a vehicle without
OL,13,Fconsent, drink-driving and driving
OL,14,Fwith no insurance or licence.
OL,16,FDefence solicitor Adele Graham asked
OL,17,Ffor the case to be adjourned for
OL,18,Fpreparation of a pre-sentence report.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1785514721
OL,3,CBlind man who drink-drove 150 miles
OL,4,C'followed HGV lights'
OL,6,F"There are a lot of circumstances, I
OL,7,Fwould submit, that do need to be
OL,8,Fconsidered before passing sentence a
OL,9,Flot of personal circumstances
OL,10,Fsurrounding Mr Hall's life and
OL,11,Fbackground," said Miss Graham.
OL,13,FMagistrates adjourned the case for a
OL,14,Freport. Hall is due to be sentenced at
OL,15,FHuddersfield Magistrates' Court on 8
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FIn the meantime Hall has been handed
OL,19,Fan interim driving ban, despite him
OL,20,Fhaving no licence.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@LO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
